    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"#Test a Fix\\n\\nSeveral _Behind the Scenes_ clips were removed from the training data. \\n\\nClick on the **Filter** button and choose:\\n\\n> Clip Type: Behind the Scenes  \\n\\nExamine the new training data and make a prediction in your Activity Guide as to whether removing some of this data will fix the model's incorrect prediction. Why or why not?\\n\\nTrain the new decision tree.\",\r\n  \"results\": \"#Test a Fix\\n\\n###Data Tracing Steps\\n\\n**Step One**: Retest the example from Level 3: \\\"_Behind the scenes: the famous lead teaches the crew a silly dance_\\\"\\n\\n>**Clip Type**: Behind the Scenes  \\n> **Length**: Short  \\n> **Famous Actor**: Yes  \\n> **Funny**: Yes  \\n\\n**Step Two** - Click the Replay button to trace the path through the tree.\\n\\n**Step Three** - Check the training data by clicking the decision node and clicking on Training rows.\\n\\nWas your prediction correct? Why or why not?\"\r\n}",
